<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8205] Services are not redeployed when cluster is getting activated</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8205</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start a node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Activate the cluster&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Deploy a service&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Deactivate the cluster&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Activate the cluster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Service is getting cancelled after the step 4, but not coming back after the step 5.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test class with a reproducer is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
